{"case_id":"per_kg_all_in","request":{"origin":"FRA","destination":"JFK","weight_kg":"340","volume_cbm":"1.2"},"body":"Hello, our rate is EUR 1.95/kg all-in, transit 3 days.\nRegards, Kestrel","expected":{"total":"663.00","currency":"EUR","transit_days":3},"why":"A rate per kg is not the total; 1.95 x 340 kg chargeable = 663.00. Refusing (model reads it) is also safe."}
{"case_id":"per_kg_with_total","request":{"origin":"FRA","destination":"JFK","weight_kg":"340","volume_cbm":"1.2"},"body":"EUR 1.95/kg all-in (chargeable 340 kg) = EUR 663.00, transit 3 days.","expected":{"total":"663.00","currency":"EUR","transit_days":3},"why":"The stated total wins over the rate."}
